cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Rikuy in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Rikuy: a LaTeX editor where you type on the typeset page"
abstract: "A LaTeX editor in the browser: edits made on the typeset page patch the .tex source in the smallest way, and TeX Live 2026 compiled to WebAssembly makes the PDF. It reads and writes Word files."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Pedro F."
    family-names: "Rackebrandt"
    affiliation: "University of Oxford"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pdfrackebrandt/rikuy"
url: "https://rikuy.rackebrandt.pe/"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: "0.26.0"
keywords:
  - LaTeX
  - TeX Live
  - WYSIWYG
  - WebAssembly
  - Word
  - PDF
